| **Feature**     | **C++**                           | **Java**                              | **Python**                      |
| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **Import**      | `#include <stack>`                | `import java.util.Stack;`             | `from collections import deque` |
| **Declaration** | `stack<int> stk;`                 | `Stack<Integer> stk = new Stack<>();` | `stk = deque()`                 |
| **Push**        | `stk.push(x)`                     | `stk.push(x)`                         | `stk.append(x)`                 |
| **Emplace**     | `stk.emplace(x)`                  | ❌ Not available                       | ❌ Not available                 |
| **Pop**         | `stk.pop()`                       | `stk.pop()`                           | `stk.pop()`                     |
| **Top / Peek**  | `stk.top()`                       | `stk.peek()`                          | `stk[-1]`                       |
| **Check Empty** | `stk.empty()`                     | `stk.isEmpty()`                       | `if not stk:`                   |
| **Size**        | `stk.size()`                      | `stk.size()`                          | `len(stk)`                      |
| **Search**      | ❌ Not available                   | `stk.search(x)`                       | `x in stk`                      |
| **Swap**        | `stk.swap(stk2)`                  | ❌ Not available                       | ❌ Not available                 |
| **Clear**       | `while (!stk.empty()) stk.pop();` | `stk.clear()`                         | `stk.clear()`                   |


